{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "batch": 1349,
  "batch_count": 1652,
  "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
  "source_commit": "33cae8524551c593c4a9016580345724140f0481",
  "source_language": "zh-CN",
  "entries": [
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d71151e55e4672e9c89dff50",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "虽然落得个万劫不复的下场\r\n也不是不可能，不过……\r\n就让你好好见识一下困兽的挣扎吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "20cd7ee393a0ac776ccb96240639d45d46e8b93915b6ad5694bcb7e0f6b5ca34",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1049",
        "20037"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:788a5cd36cdb5a5159faf126",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "上吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "2eb0d881cd80a16baae5d41c1d7268ab2194b50e1175597b0547df0c45d47e02",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1049",
        "20038"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1cc347309e09b8895de6574b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "哈！",
      "source_fingerprint": "fc0501efee4b0f3383bb7aec7aad844316d4c933d1bdf46490754f5510264817",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1049",
        "20039"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c3316312af54395bf85cdb25",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "成吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "446af46d4a9f2f9794e51c79a554510f600e7cbcb99926bf751051505c331af8",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1049",
        "20040"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2f4408b0bcce19ec4fb00596",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我看看……",
      "source_fingerprint": "fda61eb32f61c6da78a05b96362d85eee3de2a47cf26c7a61912e8b54de91c25",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1049",
        "20041"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0a161a799d1bf4f717a670e6",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "哼。",
      "source_fingerprint": "758a23ba3b4ff252a4e5eac29e32085c8aaa84f0e672e96ad91d5390fb0aa06e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1049",
        "20042"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3757936e7e7d30c7272b4c12",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "哎呀哎呀……",
      "source_fingerprint": "993e23389c43da2f176ab81b73a0978425d7ee5caf9d7c8d3499bf0ae60cb631",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1049",
        "20043"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:76fc4aec948e43797c77591c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "来了啊。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d7ed55e7c3bfe3ff2cdc7d9fbb1789b058a1c6526c80b7a981afb59defd17c94",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1049",
        "20046"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8fa84ff3901c4c49fb5f72d8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "不错的海浪声呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "860aee6ca3359b4f6a21648a6724bacc695f7c92a3e403776822098e9e35ae7c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1049",
        "20047"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c609216cc7268f3f3868dcd8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "和你一起干蠢事的感觉……还不赖。",
      "source_fingerprint": "0b711b38f28aac4185b1f2fc8f2669e298ccb34440153e4e7219c40834b142e2",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1049",
        "20049"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:dba89f70d42a8b8a448dc8f4",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "多谢你的照顾啦。",
      "source_fingerprint": "49d27f6ca69c761e21767cf7d2eef1aba5590bc8eb8036b5a433bb5dee289850",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1049",
        "20050"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6517f1e4300f0fa579da6ac9",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "麻烦你陪我一会儿啦。",
      "source_fingerprint": "edd5c86c82c9c3440ad1339c434892401d89cb67b6ccf3796fe4e25d5e700919",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1049",
        "20051"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2f92785f1428817d1de0a16b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "变得有趣起来了啊！",
      "source_fingerprint": "97749ddb19142b8bbccc7be8a5cbeabc55fb347d260493017679b91da43abbe5",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1049",
        "2030"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b389781fa300868bd1464290",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "令人寒毛卓竖的时间开始了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "94aecec8a0a078ab8c0f5a8bbcc4f9e9f952641d53993f2123894fb50ec49282",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1049",
        "2031"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3cd08ce091a6e6930bb7a3a2",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "多谢你的照顾啦。",
      "source_fingerprint": "49d27f6ca69c761e21767cf7d2eef1aba5590bc8eb8036b5a433bb5dee289850",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1049",
        "2032"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:749526d2b4236348f81e4841",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "以自己的双腿改变胜利的流向……\r\n如果是现在的我，也许能做到了吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "7b716e7cb57dec0cb475770a61661052c25e7ca69491c8e4b963ea4f290b209c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1049",
        "2033"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:97155b0c3676d8ea50c3e12d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "不用再多说什么了吧。\r\n接下来，就是燃烧你我二人生命的\r\n时刻了……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "9619f13bf4aaa87879c47772acb4e6c5ebe310fe37d5749c9a7cab5cde64569e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1049",
        "2034"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:03d907a31d57af42dbcd3f23",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "多谢你的照顾啦。",
      "source_fingerprint": "49d27f6ca69c761e21767cf7d2eef1aba5590bc8eb8036b5a433bb5dee289850",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1049",
        "2035"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d730a8381e87ef48ce51780d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "さァ！",
      "source_fingerprint": "64e5a5aa4ec8ebb86f21dd89570951a55dbbcb6b3d0091a038c911523b54170f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1049",
        "23015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:04dd4779ddf6481c1fe37397",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "虽然输是输了……\r\n不过也算是场让人愉快的对决吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "21e4cd7db56f79a7ee61a0dd142b25b08106147ab2b4809605dc8fc48f49229c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1049",
        "30000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:aa7e60bf7a56ca54b6058f42",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "只差一步……\r\n真是场让人汗毛倒竖的对决啊。",
      "source_fingerprint": "7ec81d6138815d11f13cad369c208bf371eb51a7d32d30f73a774dec97d51959",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1049",
        "30001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5b97dfc0515fab2c16a37fed",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "支离破碎……吗。",
      "source_fingerprint": "e5effc3ee7f99303e4ba5ed6d48b8f571f0fc81ccb561b47a3b4a974a644cbdd",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1049",
        "30002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:adfc0d0db8c01dee8cbf7909",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "根本激动不起来啊……",
      "source_fingerprint": "868f2ce9c94c207de44d9584449ab9a63acd94e4f4c6faafafbd259384ede8ae",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1049",
        "30003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9169e5d2826ceec12fb8db10",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "哈哈哈哈哈！\r\n心脏正在狂吠不止啊！",
      "source_fingerprint": "247dce2651b2effe2b74ed026f7b3dbdba39eab48887d9fddfa918fc31d7c64f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1049",
        "30004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8eea83ce4d0ea1a946542337",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "看来是老天爷赏脸了啊。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c88f45eca9781d92ae27e1d92e207a37bbb2deed27592cef4a4d3735d83f6735",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1049",
        "30005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c5f06cf0b7ca52d1e4bd89a2",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "来吧，投骰！",
      "source_fingerprint": "f746b807c0e99d9afb8a8167603c43b7fd90b0485d85e9e9366ee168eab9ce91",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1049",
        "31000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d029edd7f569c6fa9f822fc5",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "来场让人汗毛倒竖的赌局吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "e8d51f5dc010e5c2a6dde1d1ed17ef69dcc248ebca22020b24e39a5bb130c7cb",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1049",
        "40000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fd18960b8caa42bc947d8c8e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我对度假啊玩水啊什么的都没兴趣。\r\n只有孤注一掷的大豪赌才能\r\n令我满足……",
      "source_fingerprint": "916fc436b984698a789c4241d75e2d988af5347704f85e50ed158bfcdc0942ae",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1049",
        "400005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:dd22c5303889d4a6f47c6c44",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "哈哈！\r\n居然能找到这么有趣的对局……！\r\n跟老师可算有得聊了啊……",
      "source_fingerprint": "02a008116cca8fef49e24b8b2bacb315781293c433f22f33c88edcc261ae563a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1049",
        "400008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:29815ff4a44eab835136e43c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "好了，开始吧。\r\n最糟也是最棒的时间……\r\n享受这业火般的激情吧……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "2442b02467b038a8dc667db47e4bdbae0182d3dd3692eb5bde71bbd7b69b79fc",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1049",
        "40001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e958b81a6fdb4ba784de762d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "那家伙做的炒面还挺好吃的啊。\r\n在尽情出了汗水之后，\r\n就是该吃这种口味重的东西……",
      "source_fingerprint": "a57f9237a6416f66ba0cc47f3231e5b1d3aac4d03804c15167b13a95405e1b23",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1049",
        "400014"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3a174e2c35ed5dab367df165",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "好啦，既然是赴宴就该盛装出席吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "95497b73e0825feab4c6d8dd6c77db3f89a3469695faa1600dfe3c6876cf36e4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1049",
        "60000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0c07aca38cda3e961ee4727a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "也算是送给那些\r\n见证赌局的家伙们的伴手礼吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "e9c36021f0757c3a26bb882912a21313666360a3d5601220114703688096e703",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1049",
        "60001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ba9866ab806cc63ecaab67dc",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "尽情享受这千钧一发的对决吧？",
      "source_fingerprint": "a05b3051661c58cef8b2ba689ed7ba9915bd412f99ce77ae026fcb9dd4b08c69",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1049",
        "70000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1c18ade1dcb35ae942adc81f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我和你都是无药可救的大笨蛋啊。\r\n……现在想想，好像我们从一开始\r\n就已经是那副德行了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "dd06ec8b6fc7c1cd2a5db696b7e2c52c028a2e83c5d8fc03d8233fc76e7601ce",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1049",
        "70001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8062f0827a9301a959ca9021",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "穿制服的时候我也是会老老实实的啦……\r\n……马马虎虎吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "831ba39a3e4c336b551df476c560cea2d3c0c4f5a49f6ffcf0def4939b07e354",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1049",
        "70004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e7f33ad9cc1affb23501dbe2",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "虽然是有点华丽过头，\r\n但作为庆典时穿的衣服倒也不赖。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c8358211d0363bffa46121d896b9a67a2728888f25ae74efc8f344e7cb809852",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1049",
        "70008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:960367692ae92e4386a1e923",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "究竟是将赢取一切呢，\r\n还是万劫不复呢……\r\n这就是那瞬间抉择的象征。",
      "source_fingerprint": "22cdf51acd4169daf55467183f9f21379aa94b3b73eabec8ff4bf2f395b2d073",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1049",
        "70009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:db601ebead9356b3b807217b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "虽然这身衣服的样式和我不太搭吧……\r\n不过品味还是不错。",
      "source_fingerprint": "14c792f2c3120b36f05b113e2330f1c90e56aaa9e7c95042dc00f53d5373ec04",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1049",
        "70010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b5d8fd0dedd1927d059594d2",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "穿上后活动还挺顺畅的，这点不错。\r\n……合不合适什么的我才懒得管。",
      "source_fingerprint": "5af9a3b24d0b36a6f791cb532a8eca0af43f04d638eb5ed720301f70254035d9",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1049",
        "70014"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:718db967255ee5f7d4e9a83a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "只要穿着这身衣服，\r\n就会打心底里感受到那股激情……",
      "source_fingerprint": "8d6f572204f8886c6f93e0703306e9a78de29279e9b13e839b052d1ec9998810",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1049",
        "70015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8812eaaee54e667451c5a4a6",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我这样也多少算是有点讲究的人啦。",
      "source_fingerprint": "98c1aa5dbf1b49fbe1f33f40f7a7435113800de15f579c52f67d8767eab01353",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1049",
        "70018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d7d3ff15cf77a212447f81ef",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我倒是觉得这衣服和我很搭啦。",
      "source_fingerprint": "7893d845510649be314c320edec25ba3566545c0a8fb1743da7fff0dd56712d0",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1049",
        "70019"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:04058e15bcb6ccfc24273e0e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "外の世界の匂いがしみついてやがるな…。",
      "source_fingerprint": "01e274c190657e7cb22e2013574a578f0cf69538fe0b9b8530cc81c28c78ead9",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1049",
        "70020"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:faa5b26cc19d9ab96745cac6",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "服ってのは着ているうち味が出てくるもんさ。",
      "source_fingerprint": "3f6fc5505299f7fb6f9c00bdfd7122fb942bd1c9ee80ebd9808ba237e72f9e36",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1049",
        "70021"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:47342e512967bcc9ea0b4468",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "穿制服的时候我也是会老老实实的啦……\r\n……马马虎虎吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "831ba39a3e4c336b551df476c560cea2d3c0c4f5a49f6ffcf0def4939b07e354",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1049",
        "71004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e0b327d26a5c37939f8ae9cc",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "虽然是有点华丽过头，\r\n但作为庆典时穿的衣服倒也不赖。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c8358211d0363bffa46121d896b9a67a2728888f25ae74efc8f344e7cb809852",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1049",
        "71008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:85d2a08f636d3996af6bedf4",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "究竟是将赢取一切呢，\r\n还是万劫不复呢……\r\n这就是那瞬间抉择的象征。",
      "source_fingerprint": "22cdf51acd4169daf55467183f9f21379aa94b3b73eabec8ff4bf2f395b2d073",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1049",
        "71009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3b522d02fa706cbeebafa192",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "虽然这身衣服的样式和我不太搭吧……\r\n不过品味还是不错。",
      "source_fingerprint": "14c792f2c3120b36f05b113e2330f1c90e56aaa9e7c95042dc00f53d5373ec04",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1049",
        "71010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8860041fdae8ace268ab537d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "穿上后活动还挺顺畅的，这点不错。\r\n……合不合适什么的我才懒得管。",
      "source_fingerprint": "5af9a3b24d0b36a6f791cb532a8eca0af43f04d638eb5ed720301f70254035d9",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1049",
        "71014"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:09521eb07b86d07ef72edcbc",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "只要穿着这身衣服，\r\n就会打心底里感受到那股激情……",
      "source_fingerprint": "8d6f572204f8886c6f93e0703306e9a78de29279e9b13e839b052d1ec9998810",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1049",
        "71015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ff5b87b3b4f364a0b11360ef",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我这样也多少算是有点讲究的人啦。",
      "source_fingerprint": "98c1aa5dbf1b49fbe1f33f40f7a7435113800de15f579c52f67d8767eab01353",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1049",
        "71018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b0754930d04b200704b87892",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我倒是觉得这衣服和我很搭啦。",
      "source_fingerprint": "7893d845510649be314c320edec25ba3566545c0a8fb1743da7fff0dd56712d0",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1049",
        "71019"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b8145c9675ba9cdf7d5cf30e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "辛苦啦。",
      "source_fingerprint": "2844e10231fb1df80ddf92369741a345d71164ac359effd4df72193851603d28",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1049",
        "80000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b54237952f473830d2eafeaf",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "勝負か、いいだろう。\r\nしらけさせてくれるなよ？",
      "source_fingerprint": "48dd8fcc2724768a5bd3a747cfdb209f4a98ace420545bf72f4d7f744b32dcd7",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1049",
        "81000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:38fc51ba8cc730ad253587cf",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "勝ちを掴みに行く目。\r\nいいね…気に入った。",
      "source_fingerprint": "1587acb873ab11107b94e5a57399d51d65d6f13492ce684d518ed6253a603bfe",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1049",
        "81001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8542cccc7244cc17f368ca31",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "早啊。现在也是这世间\r\n最为繁忙的时候啊……\r\n无论如何都没法习惯这般喧嚣啊。",
      "source_fingerprint": "49c3e2296b46301381786025243b7bec2732f5e137f2b7c4708a072972197b2a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1049",
        "90000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ad354e19e658052ac4866411",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "你看上去还在犯困啊。\r\n要来场赌局让你打起精神吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "776cf69b79fd9af189ed80af17e5002bb9d642514cf89c39eaeb5f0902d9f5ed",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1049",
        "90001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3fdaad9b54cc48adcda057ad",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "总觉得有点困啊……\r\n让我稍微睡会儿吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "4a07b4bde55e2657bd83f6e96095a8b1641b4e1cdc442d54e8fbe29f70c54bd4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1049",
        "90002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bf411322b1c2674a1822a683",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "肚子饿了啊……说起来，\r\n有家常去的居酒屋最近也开始\r\n卖午饭了来着。",
      "source_fingerprint": "8de986c667a0ef92411db7aa839f010ad932933a1938377729784b82509cd164",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1049",
        "90003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0967af6b4fb9c513281decdf",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "夜晚真不错啊。理性的枷锁摇摇欲坠，\r\n野心开始肆意膨胀……\r\n对追求刺激的我而言再合适不过了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "e3a8a73881bb3f5b5192699fa775f4bfaf5e3eb864ee0bcd4aca329ef7f55e52",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1049",
        "90004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0e55fd40f0d0f6d9f7851fa9",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "……有只猫一直带着一副贪婪的表情\r\n在门口瞎逛悠。\r\n真是个拿它没辙的家伙啊……",
      "source_fingerprint": "454ee2c059a40891b05ed4af8fae0f9c5fb7f4ddd08fe44060c88defc33a49c3",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1049",
        "90005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a19b141396e534fe03916e55",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "天气暖和到让人犯困啊。\r\n溜出去找点儿刺激好了……",
      "source_fingerprint": "2b25788409a3801779b0a1b46c22f45e044bc914109b04463d6bc2bdbd4c5111",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1049",
        "90006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d09d83cc3c15cd7080b29705",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "太阳底下热得跟火烤似的……\r\n要能顺便往我心里也添把火的话\r\n可帮大忙啦。",
      "source_fingerprint": "cc5c0ab8a48aab5d0a2dfea9dc1b270ed06b1341fd52de6718ecede4a14c51b9",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1049",
        "90007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:46af26c13c62041249573634",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "小时候老师还请过我吃烤红薯来着。\r\n……那时的寒风与地瓜的焦香味，\r\n哼，实在让人难以忘怀啊。",
      "source_fingerprint": "379017ca20a6d44b9d2fa0e6ee1fbaab5c3be78f143d9f73a73b89916b433f3d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1049",
        "90008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:78cbbab1068b75aa60db01eb",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "赌徒的灵魂一旦被点燃，即便是\r\n寒风也不能将之扑灭……什么的。\r\n压根就不管用啊……可恶。",
      "source_fingerprint": "39b5bb1952159e693216bfac546548696c9327a134e6178dce7bcdf10109ede2",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1049",
        "90009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4a914d26f23d67a4e21d0f4f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "情人节快乐。",
      "source_fingerprint": "3f3455df99fcdf52dccf9e7b073c56d68f8d34a6868121f5a62cfc4738b1b633",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1049",
        "90020"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a2aae80add07ec809daabdf3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我刚和阿船开了一局，看我俩谁能\r\n先一步在对方的帽子里藏江米条……\r\n是时候让她看看我的本事了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "19c7352cdaeea0537e257af54a668567faa6187d462a14c9b6bfe1330c8b0163",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1049",
        "91000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8fc0c56b6941993525ab5f64",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "佐敦那家伙又来找我押题了。\r\n……不过就算我给她押中了，\r\n她还是会不及格啊。",
      "source_fingerprint": "5861ad44203b2631c2bccb71105a33e1dfed529fbbc6ec8f84eff7ad93293c68",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1049",
        "91001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7d9be98773f45ae9f72befb2",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "闪耀是那种会在做事前\r\n事无巨细规划好一切的家伙。\r\n和我完全相反啊……也挺有趣的吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "f58ab71b85a92afb45f203b82074222813e61df436a0fe0bce26eab6e47186b3",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1049",
        "91002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:305148d091753b3e77433ec2",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "老师又给我写信了啊……真是的。\r\n……每次都给她写回信\r\n可不是轻松活儿啊。",
      "source_fingerprint": "9cc319407c29ac0a987f667cf41501034955fa86e8fcfdb8538964f211d33548",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1049",
        "91003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:93e0d77d18c287da1c9823ac",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我多少也算是会做点饭菜的。\r\n……当然啦，不可能无聊到\r\n老老实实按菜谱上写的来做就是了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "6eeb3a5b35afb495c1d0bcfb938088e526b6032e21b0b2c0cef67cbf39038bff",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1049",
        "91004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d49df3a281c1ff24410e6377",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "立于陶醉的中心，操弄感情的漩涡…\r\n这么想的话，LIVE倒也不赖吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "e4fca4bd09d6ccd44f56a9c319921f0d1b62608b1966197b19f1b89c8250a1e1",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1049",
        "91005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:62dc91662f1affe4a31ccf5c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "其实我没那么讨厌那种瞎热闹的气氛哦\r\n让观众彻底被热情吞没什么的，\r\n还挺有趣的。",
      "source_fingerprint": "42838c522be1197474c36c6f8e537db64025ecc71098a958fcdfefb165e1c9c8",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1049",
        "91006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:15ec45ae9860073be8695800",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "优雅而考究的决胜服跟我简直就是\r\n八字不合。还是这身穿起来舒服……",
      "source_fingerprint": "5b525f948d286197c2146ea77705c5ec1b33c435bf4853afcacff24e330e56e2",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1049",
        "91007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:80708c25e12bc1eb710bd51d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "骰子就是对决的象征。\r\n如何？这衣服和我很搭吧？",
      "source_fingerprint": "d6b5068a6b6648f11b22d5f412ed72128de497a951593e4fa453a0d3da9f42b8",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1049",
        "91008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b52ca2aaf16afb5dcfb8fb3d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "把那帮小鬼叫醒，给他们做饭、\r\n让他们做好上学的准备……\r\n在老家的时候，早上真是忙得要死啊。",
      "source_fingerprint": "045a6d9c205f4f36afcfa2f92e4feffb60f70205e6309566ebe6126c6722263a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1049",
        "91009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:29de7eeccc4b916654c34b33",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "……开始有点想吃东西了啊。\r\n我们两头饥肠辘辘的饿兽，\r\n要一起去更繁华的地方觅食吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "9c0ef7de3203f4fec9978200144e3df4ba19a799dfc3228666d79da77918fe02",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1049",
        "91010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8e0eb4561f9a37b3ccd3b2dd",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "享乐时间到了啊。\r\n……安心，我不会干出什么\r\n会给你惹麻烦的大事的。",
      "source_fingerprint": "efd93a8a1e0be9ded2b6905be92c990dcd3abd888fbdcae8596f83e4fe31e1a8",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1049",
        "91011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c4a3b6bcfe0f29a673848ff6",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "房间里的紫罗兰又开了啊。\r\n……不管怎么看，都只是平平无奇的\r\n普通的花罢了。真是的，为啥老师她—",
      "source_fingerprint": "609d815eceb8ff5b5dc18ca0cb33b324054fec376e954a8243786bcd840230d2",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1049",
        "91012"
      ]
    }
  ]
}
